  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Investment preparation study for avocado oil production facility&#xa0;in&#xa0;Angola</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Trade Link Global B.V. (TLG) specialises in the trade, production, and marketing of avocado oil and fresh avocados. TLG works exclusively with African producers to source avocados and avocado oil, exporting them to customers in Europe (via the Netherlands), the US, and the Middle East, and also has its own production facilities.The investment preparation project involves the establishment of an avocado oil factory in Angola. Post-harvest losses of avocados are often high. TLG (together with a local partner) wants to use this avocado waste for the production of oil.TLG initially plans to establish a small-scale pilot production facility (proof-of-concept). If successful, TLG will invest in a larger production facility within 2-3 years. The study will demonstrate the commercial and operational feasibility and sustainability of scalable avocado oil production in Angola.</narrative>
  </description>
